# Testing & Quality

## Test Coverage
- Every new feature must include at least one unit test + integration test.

## Component Snapshots
- Use Storybook or equivalent to snapshot all reusable components.

## End-to-End Testing
- For user flows (auth, CRUD on entities, payments, file uploads), maintain Playwright/Cypress tests in `/tests/e2e/`.

## Build Verification
- After **every change**, verify that the build succeeds. 
- If the build fails, immediately fix all build errors before proceeding.

## Test Execution
- After **every change**, run the full test suite. 
- If any tests fail, immediately fix them before proceeding. 
- Never leave broken tests.
